{"3673220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Joycare", "steam_appid": 3673220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>The JoyCare</i> – an urban exploration horror game set in the ruins of an abandoned daycare center. What was once a place of laughter and innocence is now nothing but echoes and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a curious soul drawn to uncover the truth behind the daycare's closure… but you're not alone. Something else roams the halls — Jacky Joke, a forgotten mascot turned monster, still guards his playground. But he’s not your only concern. The Misery Master, blinded and twisted by betrayal, lurks in the darkness, hunting through sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and uncover a disturbing story buried beneath toys, murals, and blood-stained secrets. Will you escape the grasp of your worst childhood nightmare?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>The JoyCare</i> – an urban exploration horror game set in the ruins of an abandoned daycare center. What was once a place of laughter and innocence is now nothing but echoes and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a curious soul drawn to uncover the truth behind the daycare's closure… but you're not alone. Something else roams the halls — Jacky Joke, a forgotten mascot turned monster, still guards his playground. But he’s not your only concern. The Misery Master, blinded and twisted by betrayal, lurks in the darkness, hunting through sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and uncover a disturbing story buried beneath toys, murals, and blood-stained secrets. Will you escape the grasp of your worst childhood nightmare?</p>", "short_description": "Explore an abandoned daycare haunted by Jacky Joke, a twisted mascot. Survive the horror, uncover dark secrets, and escape your worst childhood nightmare in The JoyCare. This game is mad